{"v":1,"book":"Ps","ch":37,"verses":[{"n":0,"text":"Of David","tok":[{"t":"Of "},{"t":"David","s":["H1732"],"a":[0]}]},{"n":1,"text":"Do not be incensed because of evildoers; Do not be envious of wrongdoers.","tok":[{"t":"Do not be incensed because of "},{"t":"evildoers","s":["H7489"],"a":[2]},{"t":"; Do not be "},{"t":"envious","s":["H7065"],"a":[4]},{"t":" of wrongdoers."}]},{"n":2,"text":"For they soon wither like grass And fade away like green herbage.","tok":[{"t":"For they "},{"t":"soon","s":["H4120"],"a":[2]},{"t":" "},{"t":"wither","s":["H5034"],"a":[6]},{"t":" like "},{"t":"grass","s":["H2682"],"a":[1]},{"t":" And fade away like "},{"t":"green","s":["H3418"],"a":[4]},{"t":" "},{"t":"herbage","s":["H1877"],"a":[5]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":3,"text":"Trust in Jehovah, and do good; Dwell in the land, and feed on His faithfulness.","tok":[{"t":"Trust","s":["H0982"],"a":[0]},{"t":" in "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[1]},{"t":", and "},{"t":"do","s":["H6213"],"a":[2]},{"t":" "},{"t":"good","s":["H2896"],"a":[3]},{"t":"; "},{"t":"Dwell","s":["H7931"],"a":[4]},{"t":" in the "},{"t":"land","s":["H0776"],"a":[5]},{"t":", and feed on His faithfulness."}]},{"n":4,"text":"Delight yourself in Jehovah, And He will give you the requests of your heart.","tok":[{"t":"Delight","s":["H6026"],"a":[0]},{"t":" yourself in "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[2]},{"t":", And He will "},{"t":"give","s":["H5414"],"a":[3]},{"t":" you the requests of your "},{"t":"heart","s":["H3820"],"a":[6]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":5,"text":"Commit your way to Jehovah, And trust in Him; and He will act.","tok":[{"t":"Commit","s":["H1556"],"a":[0]},{"t":" your "},{"t":"way","s":["H1870"],"a":[3]},{"t":" to "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[2]},{"t":", And "},{"t":"trust","s":["H0982"],"a":[4]},{"t":" in Him; and He will act."}]},{"n":6,"text":"And He will cause your righteousness to go forth like light, And your justness like noonday.","tok":[{"t":"And He will cause your "},{"t":"righteousness","s":["H6664"],"a":[2]},{"t":" to go "},{"t":"forth","s":["H3318"],"a":[0]},{"t":" "},{"t":"like","s":["H6664"],"a":[2]},{"t":" "},{"t":"light","s":["H0216"],"a":[1]},{"t":", And your justness like "},{"t":"noonday","s":["H6672"],"a":[4]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":7,"text":"Be still before Jehovah, and wait for Him; Do not be incensed because of him who enjoys prosperity on his way, Because of the man who performs his evil schemes.","tok":[{"t":"Be still before "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[1]},{"t":", and wait for Him; Do not be incensed because of him who enjoys prosperity on his "},{"t":"way","s":["H1870"],"a":[7]},{"t":", Because of the "},{"t":"man","s":["H0376"],"a":[8]},{"t":" who performs his evil schemes."}]},{"n":8,"text":"Cease from anger and forsake wrath; Do not be incensed; it leads only to evil.","tok":[{"t":"Cease","s":["H7503"],"a":[0]},{"t":" from "},{"t":"anger","s":["H0639"],"a":[1]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"forsake","s":["H5800"],"a":[2]},{"t":" "},{"t":"wrath","s":["H2534"],"a":[3]},{"t":"; Do not be incensed; it leads only to "},{"t":"evil","s":["H7489"],"a":[7]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":9,"text":"For the evildoers will be cut off; But those who wait on Jehovah, They will inherit the land.","tok":[{"t":"For the "},{"t":"evildoers","s":["H7489"],"a":[1]},{"t":" will be cut "},{"t":"off","s":["H3772"],"a":[2]},{"t":"; But those who "},{"t":"wait","s":["H6960"],"a":[3]},{"t":" on "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[4]},{"t":", They will "},{"t":"inherit","s":["H3423"],"a":[6]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"land","s":["H0776"],"a":[7]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":10,"text":"And in a little while longer there will be no wicked man; Indeed, you will look diligently for his place, and he will not be there.","tok":[{"t":"And in a little "},{"t":"while","s":["H4592"],"a":[1]},{"t":" longer there will be no "},{"t":"wicked","s":["H7563"],"a":[3]},{"t":" man; Indeed, you will look diligently for his "},{"t":"place","s":["H4725"],"a":[6]},{"t":", and he will not be there."}]},{"n":11,"text":"But the lowly will inherit the land And delight themselves in the abundance of peace.","tok":[{"t":"But the lowly will "},{"t":"inherit","s":["H3423"],"a":[1]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"land","s":["H0776"],"a":[2]},{"t":" And "},{"t":"delight","s":["H6026"],"a":[3]},{"t":" themselves in the "},{"t":"abundance","s":["H7230"],"a":[5]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"peace","s":["H7965"],"a":[6]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":12,"text":"The wicked man makes evil schemes against the righteous man And gnashes his teeth at him.","tok":[{"t":"The "},{"t":"wicked","s":["H7563"],"a":[1]},{"t":" man makes evil schemes against the righteous man And "},{"t":"gnashes","s":["H2786"],"a":[3]},{"t":" his "},{"t":"teeth","s":["H8127"],"a":[5]},{"t":" at him."}]},{"n":13,"text":"The Lord will laugh at him, For He sees that his day will come.","tok":[{"t":"The "},{"t":"Lord","s":["H0136"],"a":[0]},{"t":" will "},{"t":"laugh","s":["H7832"],"a":[1]},{"t":" at him, For He sees that his "},{"t":"day","s":["H3117"],"a":[7]},{"t":" will "},{"t":"come","s":["H0935"],"a":[6]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":14,"text":"The wicked have drawn out the sword And bent their bow, To cast the poor and the needy down, To slaughter those who are upright in their way.","tok":[{"t":"The "},{"t":"wicked","s":["H7563"],"a":[2]},{"t":" have drawn "},{"t":"out","s":["H6605"],"a":[1]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"sword","s":["H2719"],"a":[0]},{"t":" And "},{"t":"bent","s":["H1869"],"a":[3]},{"t":" their "},{"t":"bow","s":["H7198"],"a":[4]},{"t":", To "},{"t":"cast","s":["H5307"],"a":[5]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"poor","s":["H6041"],"a":[6]},{"t":" and the "},{"t":"needy","s":["H0034"],"a":[7]},{"t":" "},{"t":"down","s":["H5307"],"a":[5]},{"t":", To slaughter those who are "},{"t":"upright","s":["H3477"],"a":[9]},{"t":" in their way."}]},{"n":15,"text":"Their sword will enter their own heart, And their bows will be broken.","tok":[{"t":"Their "},{"t":"sword","s":["H2719"],"a":[0]},{"t":" will "},{"t":"enter","s":["H0935"],"a":[1]},{"t":" their own "},{"t":"heart","s":["H3820"],"a":[2]},{"t":", And their "},{"t":"bows","s":["H7198"],"a":[3]},{"t":" will be "},{"t":"broken","s":["H7665"],"a":[4]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":16,"text":"Better is the little that the righteous man has Than the abundance of many wicked.","tok":[{"t":"Better","s":["H2896"],"a":[0]},{"t":" is the "},{"t":"little","s":["H4592"],"a":[1]},{"t":" that the righteous "},{"t":"man","s":["H6662"],"a":[2]},{"t":" has Than the abundance of "},{"t":"many","s":["H7227"],"a":[5]},{"t":" "},{"t":"wicked","s":["H7563"],"a":[4]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":17,"text":"For the arms of the wicked will be broken, But Jehovah upholds the righteous.","tok":[{"t":"For the "},{"t":"arms","s":["H2220"],"a":[1]},{"t":" of the "},{"t":"wicked","s":["H7563"],"a":[2]},{"t":" will be "},{"t":"broken","s":["H7665"],"a":[3]},{"t":", But "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[6]},{"t":" "},{"t":"upholds","s":["H5564"],"a":[4]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"righteous","s":["H6662"],"a":[5]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":18,"text":"Jehovah knows the days of the perfect, And their inheritance will be forever.","tok":[{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[1]},{"t":" "},{"t":"knows","s":["H3045"],"a":[0]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"days","s":["H3117"],"a":[2]},{"t":" of the perfect, And their "},{"t":"inheritance","s":["H5159"],"a":[4]},{"t":" will be forever."}]},{"n":19,"text":"They will not be put to shame in a time of evil, And in the days of famine they will be satisfied.","tok":[{"t":"They will not be put to shame in a "},{"t":"time","s":["H6256"],"a":[2]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"evil","s":["H7451"],"a":[3]},{"t":", And in the "},{"t":"days","s":["H3117"],"a":[4]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"famine","s":["H7459"],"a":[5]},{"t":" they will be "},{"t":"satisfied","s":["H7646"],"a":[6]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":20,"text":"But the wicked will perish, And the enemies of Jehovah will be like the glory of the pastures: They are consumed; in smoke they are consumed.","tok":[{"t":"But the "},{"t":"wicked","s":["H7563"],"a":[1]},{"t":" will "},{"t":"perish","s":["H0006"],"a":[2]},{"t":", And the "},{"t":"enemies","s":["H0341"],"a":[3]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[4]},{"t":" will be like the glory of the pastures: They are "},{"t":"consumed","s":["H3615"],"a":[7]},{"t":"; in "},{"t":"smoke","s":["H6227"],"a":[8]},{"t":" they are consumed."}]},{"n":21,"text":"The wicked one borrows but does not repay, But the righteous one is gracious and gives.","tok":[{"t":"The "},{"t":"wicked","s":["H7563"],"a":[1]},{"t":" one "},{"t":"borrows","s":["H3867"],"a":[0]},{"t":" but does not repay, But the "},{"t":"righteous","s":["H6662"],"a":[4]},{"t":" one is gracious and "},{"t":"gives","s":["H5414"],"a":[6]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":22,"text":"For those blessed by Him will inherit the land, But those cursed by Him will be cut off.","tok":[{"t":"For those "},{"t":"blessed","s":["H1288"],"a":[1]},{"t":" by Him will "},{"t":"inherit","s":["H3423"],"a":[2]},{"t":" the land, But those "},{"t":"cursed","s":["H7043"],"a":[4]},{"t":" by Him will be cut "},{"t":"off","s":["H3772"],"a":[5]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":23,"text":"A man’s steps are established by Jehovah, And He delights in his way.","tok":[{"t":"A man’s "},{"t":"steps","s":["H4703"],"a":[1]},{"t":" are established by "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[0]},{"t":", And He "},{"t":"delights","s":["H2654"],"a":[5]},{"t":" in his "},{"t":"way","s":["H1870"],"a":[4]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":24,"text":"If he falls, he is not utterly cast down; For Jehovah upholds him by the hand.","tok":[{"t":"If he "},{"t":"falls","s":["H5307"],"a":[1]},{"t":", he is not utterly cast "},{"t":"down","s":["H2904"],"a":[3]},{"t":"; For "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[5]},{"t":" "},{"t":"upholds","s":["H5564"],"a":[6]},{"t":" him by the "},{"t":"hand","s":["H3027"],"a":[7]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":25,"text":"I was once a young man; now I am old. Yet I have not seen the righteous man forsaken, Nor his seed seeking bread.","tok":[{"t":"I was once a "},{"t":"young","s":["H5288"],"a":[0]},{"t":" man; now I am "},{"t":"old","s":["H2204"],"a":[3]},{"t":". Yet I have not "},{"t":"seen","s":["H7200"],"a":[5]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"righteous","s":["H6662"],"a":[6]},{"t":" man "},{"t":"forsaken","s":["H5800"],"a":[7]},{"t":", Nor his "},{"t":"seed","s":["H2233"],"a":[8]},{"t":" "},{"t":"seeking","s":["H1245"],"a":[9]},{"t":" "},{"t":"bread","s":["H3899"],"a":[10]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":26,"text":"He is always gracious and lends, And his seed becomes a blessing.","tok":[{"t":"He is always gracious and "},{"t":"lends","s":["H3867"],"a":[3]},{"t":", And his "},{"t":"seed","s":["H2233"],"a":[4]},{"t":" becomes a "},{"t":"blessing","s":["H1293"],"a":[5]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":27,"text":"Turn away from evil and do good, And abide forever.","tok":[{"t":"Turn away from "},{"t":"evil","s":["H7451"],"a":[1]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"do","s":["H6213"],"a":[2]},{"t":" "},{"t":"good","s":["H2896"],"a":[3]},{"t":", And abide forever."}]},{"n":28,"text":"For Jehovah loves justice And does not abandon His faithful ones; They are kept forever; But the seed of the wicked is cut off.","tok":[{"t":"For "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[1]},{"t":" "},{"t":"loves","s":["H0157"],"a":[2]},{"t":" justice And does not abandon His faithful ones; They are kept forever; But the "},{"t":"seed","s":["H2233"],"a":[10]},{"t":" of the "},{"t":"wicked","s":["H7563"],"a":[11]},{"t":" is cut "},{"t":"off","s":["H3772"],"a":[12]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":29,"text":"The righteous will inherit the land, And they will abide in it forever.","tok":[{"t":"The "},{"t":"righteous","s":["H6662"],"a":[0]},{"t":" will "},{"t":"inherit","s":["H3423"],"a":[1]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"land","s":["H0776"],"a":[2]},{"t":", And they will abide in it forever."}]},{"n":30,"text":"The mouth of the righteous utters wisdom, And his tongue speaks justice.","tok":[{"t":"The "},{"t":"mouth","s":["H6310"],"a":[0]},{"t":" of the "},{"t":"righteous","s":["H6662"],"a":[1]},{"t":" "},{"t":"utters","s":["H1897"],"a":[2]},{"t":" "},{"t":"wisdom","s":["H2451"],"a":[3]},{"t":", And his "},{"t":"tongue","s":["H3956"],"a":[4]},{"t":" "},{"t":"speaks","s":["H1897"],"a":[2]},{"t":" justice."}]},{"n":31,"text":"The law of his God is in his heart; His steps do not slip.","tok":[{"t":"The "},{"t":"law","s":["H8451"],"a":[0]},{"t":" of his "},{"t":"God","s":["H0430"],"a":[1]},{"t":" is in his "},{"t":"heart","s":["H3820"],"a":[2]},{"t":"; His "},{"t":"steps","s":["H0838"],"a":[5]},{"t":" do not slip."}]},{"n":32,"text":"The wicked man watches for the righteous man And seeks to slay him.","tok":[{"t":"The "},{"t":"wicked","s":["H7563"],"a":[1]},{"t":" man "},{"t":"watches","s":["H6822"],"a":[0]},{"t":" for the "},{"t":"righteous","s":["H6662"],"a":[2]},{"t":" man And "},{"t":"seeks","s":["H1245"],"a":[3]},{"t":" to "},{"t":"slay","s":["H4191"],"a":[4]},{"t":" him."}]},{"n":33,"text":"Jehovah does not leave him in his hand, Nor let him be condemned when he is judged.","tok":[{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[0]},{"t":" does not "},{"t":"leave","s":["H5800"],"a":[2]},{"t":" him in his "},{"t":"hand","s":["H3027"],"a":[3]},{"t":", Nor let him be "},{"t":"condemned","s":["H7561"],"a":[5]},{"t":" when he is "},{"t":"judged","s":["H8199"],"a":[6]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":34,"text":"Wait for Jehovah, And keep His way; And He will exalt you to inherit the land; When the wicked are cut off, you will see it.","tok":[{"t":"Wait","s":["H6960"],"a":[0]},{"t":" for "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[2]},{"t":", And "},{"t":"keep","s":["H8104"],"a":[3]},{"t":" His "},{"t":"way","s":["H1870"],"a":[4]},{"t":"; And He will "},{"t":"exalt","s":["H7311"],"a":[5]},{"t":" you to "},{"t":"inherit","s":["H3423"],"a":[6]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"land","s":["H0776"],"a":[7]},{"t":"; When the "},{"t":"wicked","s":["H7563"],"a":[9]},{"t":" are cut "},{"t":"off","s":["H3772"],"a":[8]},{"t":", you will "},{"t":"see","s":["H7200"],"a":[10]},{"t":" it."}]},{"n":35,"text":"I have seen the wicked man terrorizing, And spreading himself like a luxuriant native tree.","tok":[{"t":"I have "},{"t":"seen","s":["H7200"],"a":[0]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"wicked","s":["H7563"],"a":[1]},{"t":" man terrorizing, And "},{"t":"spreading","s":["H6168"],"a":[3]},{"t":" himself like a luxuriant native "},{"t":"tree","s":["H0249"],"a":[4]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":36,"text":"Then someone passes by, and behold, he is not there; I search for him, and he is not found.","tok":[{"t":"Then someone passes by, and behold, he is not there; I search for him, and he is not "},{"t":"found","s":["H4672"],"a":[5]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":37,"text":"Observe the perfect man, and watch the upright man; For there is a future for the man of peace.","tok":[{"t":"Observe","s":["H8104"],"a":[0]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"perfect","s":["H8535"],"a":[1]},{"t":" man, and watch the "},{"t":"upright","s":["H3477"],"a":[3]},{"t":" man; For there is a future for the "},{"t":"man","s":["H0376"],"a":[6]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"peace","s":["H7965"],"a":[7]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":38,"text":"But the transgressors will be altogether destroyed; The future of the wicked will be cut off.","tok":[{"t":"But the "},{"t":"transgressors","s":["H6586"],"a":[0]},{"t":" will be altogether "},{"t":"destroyed","s":["H8045"],"a":[1]},{"t":"; The future of the "},{"t":"wicked","s":["H7563"],"a":[4]},{"t":" will be cut "},{"t":"off","s":["H3772"],"a":[5]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":39,"text":"And the salvation of the righteous is from Jehovah; He is their stronghold in a time of distress.","tok":[{"t":"And the "},{"t":"salvation","s":["H8668"],"a":[0]},{"t":" of the "},{"t":"righteous","s":["H6662"],"a":[1]},{"t":" is from "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[2]},{"t":"; He is their stronghold in a "},{"t":"time","s":["H6256"],"a":[4]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"distress","s":["H6869"],"a":[5]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":40,"text":"And Jehovah helps them and rescues them; He rescues them from the wicked, And saves them, for they take refuge in Him.","tok":[{"t":"And "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[1]},{"t":" "},{"t":"helps","s":["H5826"],"a":[0]},{"t":" them and rescues them; He rescues them from the "},{"t":"wicked","s":["H7563"],"a":[4]},{"t":", And "},{"t":"saves","s":["H3467"],"a":[5]},{"t":" them, for they take refuge in Him."}]}]}
